cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the methodology or the toolbox, please cite the repository."
title: "paired-eval: a paired-evaluation toolbox for LLM models, agents and harnesses"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alloevil/paired-eval"
url: "https://github.com/alloevil/paired-eval"
keywords:
  - llm-evaluation
  - paired-comparison
  - mutation-testing
  - statistics
authors:
  - name: "paired-eval contributors"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency Python toolbox for paired evaluation of models, agents and harnesses:
  interleaved repeated runs, McNemar and permutation tests with Holm correction, minimum
  detectable effect and p-floor diagnostics, a verifier spectrum from exact matching to
  rubric judging, and self-verification through mutation testing.
